meta {
  name: Confirm two-factor setup
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/api/auth/2fa/confirm
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "appCode": "000000"
  }
}

docs {
  UC-37. Authenticated.

  Prove control of every method selected when enabling: appCode if App was selected, emailCode if Email was, both if both. A missing or wrong code answers 401 "The password or code is incorrect.". Answers ten recovery codes in plaintext, exactly once — they are not retrievable afterwards.

  Revokes every token the person holds, this one included: keep the codes, then sign in again (now through 2fa/verify).
}
